^"usage"{
  surface: "primes"
  role: "cutout-arrangement"
  formats_available: ["avif", "webp"]
  ground: "clear — the black behind the cutouts was the scanner lid seen through a clear sheet (creator, 2026-09-28), so every tier keys it to transparent; a page gives the piece its ground"
  alt_text: "Cutouts on a clear sheet: line-drawn figures with spiral eyes and full lips; pick a lens; The Avoidant Attachment Playbook with a Boon speech bubble; Travel lettered upside down; Practice, Operationalize, Boon HONK; Intergenerational Media Literacy; the crush chart; the kraft key."
